WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:21.360
Choose a one-time custom charge. Open Family charge and select Custom charge for an approved entered amount. Check existing coverage first.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:31.992
Enter the approved charge amount. Use the approved amount for this exact family. This demonstration prepares a $50 training fee.

00:00:31.992 --> 00:00:42.624
Describe the charge and due date. Specify what the charge covers and the intended due date. Creating an invoice does not submit a payment.

00:00:42.624 --> 00:00:55.121
Review before saving. Review family, amount, due date and service period. After authorized creation, verify one invoice on the ledger. This recording creates none.

